+/**
+ * "Cyber Obsidian" — the app's visual identity.
+ *
+ * Near-black base, neon cyan for "system/live" accents, violet for "her"
+ * accents. Surfaces are flat glass cards separated by 1dp translucent borders
+ * (see ChatScreen) rather than harsh shadows.
